case('intent-stable-key','Intent-stable retry identity','意图稳定的重试身份','workflow',P,158,171,
 'Identify one intended action independently from its delivery attempts.','Generate an identity once at the initiating intent and reuse it across retries; distinct intents get distinct identities.','Retry an asset-upload job after a timeout.','Create a new UUID on every retry.','Assign the upload intent its key once, retain that key in the task ledger and reuse it on all attempts; a new upload receives a new key.','Retries can be recognized without collapsing distinct actions.','The receiver must honor the identity; a header alone does not make side effects idempotent.','将一次预期动作的身份与送达尝试分离。','在意图发起处生成一次身份并重试复用，不同意图不同身份。','资产上传超时后重试。','每次重试生成新UUID。','上传意图只赋一次键，保留在台账并每次复用；新上传用新键。','可识别重试而不合并不同动作。','接收方须落实身份，只有请求头不能使副作用幂等。')
case('atomic-claim-payload','Atomic claim with payload binding','原子认领与载荷绑定','orchestration',P,173,202,
 'Claim an action in one operation and bind its identity to the original payload.','Use an atomic uniqueness gate before execution; reject a reused key whose canonical payload differs, and define in-flight duplicate behavior.','Two workers receive the same publish request.','Both check not seen, publish, then record the key.','One unique claim wins before publishing; the duplicate waits or returns pending; a changed article under the same key is rejected.','Concurrent delivery does not bypass the same-intent guard.','An atomic local claim cannot prove an external effect completed; crash recovery still needs the unknown-outcome protocol.','以单操作认领动作，并将身份绑定原载荷。','执行前原子唯一门控；同键规范载荷不同则拒绝，明确运行中重复行为。','两工作者收到同一发布请求。','都先查未见，再发布后记键。','发布前唯一认领一方获胜；重复等待或返回处理中；同键不同文章拒绝。','并发送达不绕过同意图门。','本地原子认领不证明外部效果完成，崩溃仍需未知结果恢复。')
case('unknown-effect','Preserve unknown side-effect outcomes','保留未知副作用结果','safety',P,204,215,
 'A timeout is an unknown effect outcome, not evidence that the action failed.','Record intent before the external call, preserve pending/unknown state and reconcile the effect before blindly repeating it; retain identity through the longest redelivery path.','A remote issue-creation call times out.','Treat timeout as failure and create the issue again with a new key.','Keep the recorded request as unknown, check the remote request/result identity, and only retry through the same guarded intent after reconciliation.','An uncertain acknowledgment does not silently duplicate an external action.','Recovery depends on destination lookup/idempotency support; report unresolved uncertainty when it cannot be reconciled.','超时是效果未知，不是动作失败的证据。','外部调用前记意图，保留待定未知，盲重做前协调效果；身份覆盖最长重投路径。','远端建问题调用超时。','当失败处理，用新键再建问题。','已记请求留未知，查远端请求结果身份，协调后仅经同一门控意图重试。','不确定确认不暗中复制外部动作。','恢复依赖目的地查询或幂等支持，无法协调须报告未定。')
case('question-to-signal','Question-to-signal observability','问题到信号的可观测性','tools','skills/observability-and-instrumentation/SKILL.md',27,54,
 'Choose instrumentation from the questions an operator must answer.','Name diagnostic questions first, then map each to an event, aggregate or path trace; omit signals with no declared use.','Instrument a background import workflow.','Dump every payload and add counters without a question.','Ask which imports fail, where time is spent and whether retries duplicate work; emit bounded status events, duration metrics and linked run traces.','Each signal has a concrete decision or investigation it supports.','The source logs/metrics/traces mnemonic is a heuristic; verify that actual data answers the question.','按操作人必须回答的问题选择仪表。','先命名诊断问题，再映事件、聚合或路径轨迹，无用途信号省略。','给后台导入流程加观测。','倾倒所有载荷，随意加计数。','问哪些失败、耗时在哪、重试是否重复；输出有界状态事件、时长指标和关联轨迹。','每信号支持具体决策或调查。','日志指标轨迹口诀是启发式，须验证真实数据能答问题。')
case('verify-instrumentation','Verify the evidence channel itself','验证证据通道自身','evaluation','skills/observability-and-instrumentation/SKILL.md',190,197,
 'Check the telemetry path by generating a known signal and finding it through the intended channel.','Use an authorized isolated test to induce an error/event, trace its identifier and verify structured fields, labels, propagation and alert delivery.','Add monitoring for an import failure.','Declare monitoring ready because the logging code exists.','Induce one test import failure, find its run ID in the aggregator, follow its trace and verify the test alert points to the right runbook.','Instrumentation availability is distinguished from a working evidence path.','Induced failures and notifications must stay within authorized test scope; this audit did not fire any alerts.','生成已知信号并从预期通道找回，以核对遥测路径。','在已授权隔离测试诱发错误事件，追身份并核结构字段标签传播与报警送达。','添加导入失败监控。','有日志代码就称监控就绪。','诱发一次测试失败，在聚合器找运行ID、追轨迹，并核测试报警指向正确手册。','区分仪表存在与证据路径工作。','诱错与通知须限授权测试，本审计未触发任何报警。')
case('mode-evidence-provenance','Preserve measurement source kinds','保留测量来源类型','output','agents/web-performance-auditor.md',12,53,
 'Separate static potential-impact findings from lab, field and trace measurements.','Select mode from available artifacts, label every populated value with its source kind, and leave unmeasured fields explicitly unmeasured.','Audit a web page from source and a Lighthouse report.','Invent a real-user p75 from a static scan or relabel the lab result as field data.','Mark static findings potential impact; show the report value as Lab with its conditions, and keep Field p75 not measured.','Numbers retain the meaning and limitations of their source.','A source label does not validate the artifact or make different populations/runs comparable.','区分静态潜在影响与实验室、真实用户、轨迹测量。','按可用产物选模式，各值标来源类型，未测字段明确未测。','凭源码和Lighthouse报告审网页。','静态扫描编真实用户p75，或把实验室结果改称用户数据。','静态发现标潜在影响，报告值标实验室及条件，用户p75留未测。','数字保留来源含义边界。','来源标签不验证产物，也不使不同群体运行可比。')
case('leaf-orchestration','Separate workflow, perspective and entry point','分离流程、视角与入口','orchestration','docs/agents.md',16,52,
 'Keep domain work in leaf roles and orchestration at the entry point that owns the decision.','Distinguish reusable process, reviewer perspective and user-facing command; choose direct invocation for one lens and flat fan-out plus main merge for independent lenses.','Review a release for code and security concerns.','Add coordinator personas that delegate through several paraphrasing layers.','Have the release entry point dispatch two independent leaf reports and reconcile them directly against the release contract.','Routing depth and decision ownership are explicit.','Flat independent reports fit known-artifact verdicts; shared hypothesis investigation may require interaction instead.','领域工作留叶角色，编排由拥有决策的入口承担。','区别可复用流程、评审视角、面向用户命令；单视角直调，多独立视角扁平分发主合并。','评审发布的代码与安全。','多层协调人格经反复转述再委派。','发布入口分发两个独立叶报告，并直接按发布契约协调。','路由深度与决策归属明确。','扁平独立报告适于已知产物判断，假设调查可能需交互。')
case('hypothesis-versus-verdict','Choose interaction by investigation shape','按调查形状选择交互','orchestration','references/orchestration-patterns.md',176,216,
 'Choose independent reports for a known artifact and interacting investigators for competing causal hypotheses.','Ask whether the artifact is known or must be found; preserve independent judgments for verdicts, and require falsifiable evidence exchange before investigative convergence.','Investigate an intermittent queue stall.','Run three isolated reviewers and count which theory receives two votes.','Assign distinct stall hypotheses, let investigators exchange discriminating observations, and verify the surviving prediction with a focused replay before convergence.','Consensus is tied to disproof evidence rather than opinion count.','Messaging or two-agent agreement alone does not establish a root cause; source host restrictions and efficacy claims are unverified.','已知产物用独立报告，竞争因果假设用交互调查。','先问产物已知还是待找；判断保留独立性，调查收敛前交换可证伪证据。','调查间歇队列停顿。','三个隔离评审，哪个理论两票就定。','分配不同停顿假设，交换区分性观察，收敛前以聚焦回放验证存活预测。','共识联系反证，不是意见计票。','互发消息或两人同意不证明根因，宿主限制效能声明未验证。')
case('task-and-standing-bar','Task acceptance and standing readiness','任务验收与常设就绪门','evaluation','references/definition-of-done.md',3,15,
 'Require the requested behavior and the standing project readiness bar separately.','Keep per-task acceptance distinct from reusable quality/integration/operational gates and check both before completion.','Add an export button to a production page.','Declare done because the button downloads one file.','Confirm the requested export behavior, then check the accepted project bar for errors, accessibility, integration and required release evidence.','A happy-path feature result does not conceal unmet readiness conditions.','Tailor the standing bar to the actual project and authorized scope; this is different from #193 checkable-plus-exhaustive criteria.','分别要求所需行为与项目常设就绪门。','每任务验收与可复用质量集成运维门分开，完成前两者都核。','给生产页加导出按钮。','按钮下载一次文件就宣称完成。','先确认导出所需行为，再核已接受项目门中的错误、可访问、集成、发布证据。','功能快乐路径不掩盖未满足就绪条件。','常设门按实际项目授权范围定，此不同于193可检查且穷尽。')
case('one-router','One active routing authority','一个有效路由权威','context','docs/getting-started.md',43,49,
 'Avoid stacking a full meta-router on top of a host that already selects the same skills natively.','Detect the actual host discovery capability and choose one active routing authority; keep reusable skills available on demand.','Configure a host with native skill discovery.','Preload two full lifecycle routers and let both dispatch the task.','Use the native router with the installed skill descriptions; load the meta-router only where the host lacks that capability.','The same task does not receive competing dispatch protocols.','Verify effective runtime discovery; installation or metadata alone is not proof that native routing works.','避免原生已选相同技能时再常驻完整元路由。','检测真实发现能力，只选一个有效路由权威，技能按需可用。','配置有原生技能发现的宿主。','常驻两个全生命周期路由让二者都分发。','使用原生路由和已装描述；仅宿主无该能力时载元路由。','同任务不承受竞争分发协议。','须验证有效运行发现，安装或元数据不证明原生路由工作。')
