case('exemption-authority','Exemption authority outside the constrained unit','豁免权在受约束单元之外','safety','scripts/lib/skill-lint.js',83,90,
 'A unit under validation cannot grant itself an exemption from that validation.','Keep reviewed exemption policy outside the unit, require an owned reason and use exact own-membership checks rather than inherited object keys.','Validate required sections of a submitted skill.','Let the skill declare exempt: sections or qualify through a constructor prototype key.','Consult the validator-owned reviewed exemption list; reject a self-declared exemption and require a documented policy change for a real exception.','The input cannot silently authorize its own bypass.','The policy repository must itself be review-protected; moving a list alone is not an authorization boundary.','被验证单元不能给自身验证豁免。','经审豁免政策在单元外，须负责人理由，用确切自有成员而非继承对象键。','验证提交技能的必需章节。','让技能自写exempt，或constructor原型键获得豁免。','查验证器持有的经审豁免表，自述豁免拒绝，真实例外须有记录政策变更。','输入不暗中授权自身绕过。','政策仓库本身须保护评审，移个表不构成授权边界。')
case('derived-path-ownership','Resolve confinement and ownership before destruction','破坏动作前解析范围与所有权','safety','references/security-checklist.md',65,102,
 'A well-formed derived path is a candidate target, not permission to delete it.','Resolve symlinks, require a strict descendant of an allowed root and prior authenticated ownership evidence; refuse without broader fallback and address check/use races.','Clean up a job directory named in a process argument.','Trust the OS-delivered path shape and delete it or fall back to the parent root.','Resolve the candidate under the job root, verify it is below that root and owned by the authorized job, then operate under an immutable hierarchy or safe descriptor.','Misderived or attacker-written target data does not enlarge cleanup scope.','A writable marker is self-attestation; protect its integrity and bind expected owner to authenticated state.','格式正确派生路径只是目标候选，不是删除许可。','解符号链接，要求允许根的严格后代与事先认证所有权，拒绝且不扩大回退，并处理检查使用竞争。','清理由进程参数命名的工作目录。','信OS传来路径形状并删除，或回退父根。','在工作根下解析，核严格下层与授权工作所有权，再在不变层级或安全描述符操作。','派生错误或攻击者写目标不扩大清理范围。','可写标记只是自述，须保护完整性并绑定认证期望身份。')
case('install-before-execution-gate','Review installation scripts before first execution','首次执行前审安装脚本','tools','references/security-checklist.md',144,167,
 'Inspect dependency execution at the actual installation boundary before running an ordinary install.','Corroborate workspace manager/lockfile/CI, bootstrap with scripts disabled, review exact versioned scripts and record only required approvals before frozen verification.','Initialize an unfamiliar workspace for an audit.','Run the default install to discover which lifecycle scripts exist.','Identify the workspace lockfile and pinned manager; install with scripts disabled, inspect pending scripts, approve narrowly and verify the resulting frozen install policy.','Unreviewed dependency code is not executed as discovery.','Native flags/defaults are version-sensitive; this corpus matrix is a snapshot, not current verified command advice.','在真实安装边界、普通安装前检查依赖执行。','核工作区管理器锁文件CI，禁脚本引导，审确切版本脚本，只记录必要批准再冻结验证。','为审计初始化陌生工作区。','默认安装后再发现有哪些生命周期脚本。','确定工作区锁与管理器固定版本，禁脚本安装，审待执行脚本、窄授权并核冻结政策。','不以执行未经审依赖代码来发现它。','原生标志默认随版本变化，该矩阵是快照，非当前核实命令建议。')
case('abuse-case-neighbor','Abuse cases beside intended use cases','滥用例与预期用例并列','evaluation','skills/security-and-hardening/SKILL.md',25,43,
 'Derive negative scenarios from each trust boundary before selecting controls.','Name writer, asset and boundary; ask how the intended action can be misused and turn that into a testable failure scenario.','Design an import-from-URL workflow.','Validate only a successful public HTTPS import.','Alongside success, test a redirect toward an internal address, oversized content and a caller lacking import rights; choose controls for those declared abuses.','Controls are justified by named misuse paths rather than a generic checklist alone.','These are scoped test scenarios, not permission to probe arbitrary live systems.','每信任边界先导负场景再选控制。','说明写者资产边界，问预期动作如何被滥用，再变成可测失败场景。','设计URL导入流程。','只验成功公网HTTPS导入。','成功旁测向内网重定向、超大内容、调用者无导入权；为这些滥用选控制。','控制有命名滥用途径依据，不仅通用清单。','这些为范围内测试例，不授权探任意真实系统。')
case('assumption-priority','Validate kill assumptions before secondary preferences','先验证致命假设再看次要偏好','workflow','skills/idea-refine/refinement-criteria.md',75,94,
 'Classify assumptions by what their failure would do to the proposed direction.','Validate dealbreakers before implementation, important adjustable bets next and secondary optimizations after the core is supported.','Plan a tool importing partner data.','Spend the first experiment choosing button colors while assuming the partner will supply a usable feed.','First test whether the partner can and will provide the required feed; next test the update model; defer cosmetic preferences until that core assumption holds.','The first experiment can falsify the direction before costly construction.','Assumption importance depends on the actual goal; source market hierarchies and numeric heuristics are not measured efficacy.','按失败对方向的影响给假设分级。','实施前验致命点，再验可调重要赌注，核心有支持后才次要优化。','规划导入伙伴数据的工具。','首实验选按钮色，默认伙伴能给可用数据。','先验伙伴能否且愿否提供所需数据，再验更新模型，核心成立后再看外观偏好。','首实验可在昂贵构建前否证方向。','重要度依实际目标，市场层级和数字启发式非实测效能。')
case('opaque-projection','Protected content through an editable projection','通过可编辑投影保护内容','context','hooks/SIMPLIFY-IGNORE.md',42,62,
 'Keep protected content in an authoritative store while the editing view contains explicit opaque references.','Preserve original bytes and identity, edit only the intended projection, then reconstruct and verify protected content and changed surroundings before applying.','Refactor a file containing a fixed vendor block.','Show all bytes with a vague do-not-edit warning, or compile a working file after replacing its logic with comments.','Use a separate editing view with stable vendor-block sentinel, retain the original, reconstruct the patch and verify the protected block digest before applying it.','The edit contract can check both intended changes and preservation.','The observed hook modifies working files in place and uses short/fuzzy IDs; that implementation is not a security boundary or guaranteed collision-free recovery.','权威库保留受保护内容，编辑视图含明确不透明引用。','保留原字节身份，仅编辑指定投影，应用前重建并验受护内容与周边变化。','重构含固定供应商块的文件。','给全文加含糊禁改提醒，或把工作文件逻辑替成注释后编译。','单独编辑视图用稳定供应商块哨兵，保留原文，重建补丁并验块摘要后应用。','编辑契约可同时检查预期变更与保留。','观察钩子原地改工作文件且短模糊ID，不是安全边界或无碰撞恢复保证。')

